    "intro": "Most exams in this part lead to Group A posts at Level 10, but not all: EPFO Enforcement / Accounts Officer is a Group B post at Level 8, and NDA and CDS lead to commissioned ranks only after training. In recent notices the fee is ₹100 (CSE, NDA) or ₹200 (CDS, CAPF, ESE, CMS and others); women, SC, ST and PwBD are exempt. Apply on upsc.gov.in through one-time registration. Negative marking is 1/3 of the question's marks.",
