        },
        {
          "category": "otherState",
          "rule": "Same rules as other candidates"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Final-year students can usually apply for graduate exams if they will have the degree by the cut-off date in the notice.",
        "EWS gets reservation but no age relaxation in central exams.",
        "OBC relaxation applies only to the Non-Creamy Layer, with a valid central-format certificate."
